  "id": "chorizo-egg-fried-rice",
  "name": "Chorizo Egg-Fried Rice",
  "subtitle": "A quick skillet meal with crisp vegetables, peas, and egg",
  "description": "Chorizo adds savory depth to this fast fried rice, balanced with spring onions, carrot, peas, and softly set egg.",
